@startuml
title Runtime backend selection: from the macro to a per-term route

skinparam backgroundColor #FEFEFE
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam ArrowColor #374151
skinparam ArrowThickness 1.2
skinparam rectangle {
  BorderColor #1F2937
  FontColor #111827
}

rectangle "language! { ... }\nmacro emits NO_RUNTIME_BACKEND_CAPABILITIES\n(parse / introspection substrate)" as MACRO #E5E7EB

rectangle "COMPILE-TIME ELIGIBILITY GATE\ndecide_rho_flip(coverage, artifact,\ndeadlock, guard_quality)\nfail-closed: can_flip_to_rho() iff blockers empty" as GATE #FEF3C7

rectangle "WIRING\nper-language wrapper overrides\nruntime_backend_capabilities()" as WIRE #FEF3C7

rectangle "PURE DOVETAIL\nLambda, Ambient\n(Dovetail capability only)" as DOVE #DBEAFE
rectangle "HYBRID\nCalculator, RhoCalc\n(RhoMachine default + Dovetail)" as HYBRID #DCFCE7
rectangle "HOST-ROUTED\nGuardedRho\n(RhoMachine + RhoNativeJoin)" as HOST #DCFCE7

rectangle "PER-TERM ROUTE   run_backend_report(RhoMachine, t)\nD-stage Dovetail report  ->  build RhoBackendInvocation" as ROUTE #F3F4F6
rectangle "DeferToDovetailReport\nno Rho-lowerable contract:\nthe Dovetail report IS the answer" as DEFER #DBEAFE
rectangle "rhoapi::Par on F1r3node RSpace\nCOMM fires; resting data read back" as PAR #DCFCE7

MACRO --> GATE
GATE --> WIRE : can_flip_to_rho()
WIRE --> DOVE
WIRE --> HYBRID
WIRE --> HOST
HYBRID --> ROUTE
HOST --> ROUTE
ROUTE --> DEFER : fold-only / non-lowerable term
ROUTE --> PAR : COMM / scalar-dataflow term
DOVE --> DEFER : every redex in-engine

note right of GATE
  blockers: Coverage, ArtifactValidation,
  ChannelDeadlocks, GuardQuality(Unknown).
  Rust image of RhoBackendFlipGate.v.
end note

legend right
|= Color |= Meaning |
|<#FEF3C7> | compile-time classification / gate |
|<#DBEAFE> | Dovetail (in-engine rewrite) |
|<#DCFCE7> | Rholang / F1r3node host (COMM) |
|<#E5E7EB> | macro / neutral |
endlegend
@enduml
